OL,3,CBus driver arrested on suspicion of
OL,4,Cdangerous driving after collision
OL,6,FA bus driver has been arrested
OL,7,Ffollowing a serious road traffic
OL,8,Fcollision in Portsmouth.
OL,10,FPolice were called to The Hard
OL,11,FInterchange at 4:25pm on Monday 17
OL,12,FAugust, following an incident
OL,13,Finvolving a bus and a pedestrian.
OL,15,FThe road outside The Hard was closed
OL,16,Fto vehicles whilst emergency services
OL,17,Fdealt with the collision.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/3
