OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1787064556
OL,3,CBus driver arrested on suspicion of
OL,4,Cdangerous driving after collision
OL,6,FHampshire Police said a 39-year-old
OL,7,Fman from the city was arrested in
OL,8,Fsuspicion of causing serious injury by
OL,9,Fdangerous driving.
OL,11,FOfficers added he has been released on
OL,12,Fpolice bail pending further enquiries.
OL,14,FThe bus involved was a Stagecoach
OL,15,Fservice, and a spokesperson for the
OL,16,Fcompany said: "We can confirm that one
OL,17,Fof our bus drivers was involved in a
OL,18,Fcollision with a pedestrian in
OL,19,FPortsmouth yesterday, which resulted
OL,20,Fin the pedestrian sustaining injuries.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/3
