OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1787064556
OL,3,CBus driver arrested on suspicion of
OL,4,Cdangerous driving after collision
OL,6,FWe are cooperating fully with
OL,7,FHampshire Constabulary and the local
OL,8,Fauthorities, who are leading the
OL,9,Finvestigation. As the matter is
OL,10,Fongoing, it would not be appropriate
OL,11,Ffor us to comment further at this
OL,12,Fstage."
OL,14,FThe road has since reopened.
